      *****************************************************************
      * Test-harness driver for paragraph 9910-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS.
      * gen_iostatdrv.py replaces the two @...@ markers with the
      * working-storage items and the paragraph copied verbatim from
      * app/cbl/CBACT03C.cbl. Each 2-byte line of DD STATIN is moved
      * to IO-STATUS and the paragraph is performed.
      *****************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IOSTATDRV.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT STATIN-FILE ASSIGN TO STATIN
                  ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS STATIN-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  STATIN-FILE.
       01  FD-STATIN-REC           PIC X(02).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  STATIN-STATUS           PIC XX.
      *@WORKING-STORAGE@
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT STATIN-FILE
           PERFORM UNTIL STATIN-STATUS NOT = '00'
               READ STATIN-FILE
               IF STATIN-STATUS = '00'
                   MOVE FD-STATIN-REC TO IO-STATUS
                   PERFORM 9910-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE STATIN-FILE
           STOP RUN.
      *@PARAGRAPH@
